<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pre-trained model evaluation (5-shot). IHA achieves the best overall reasoning performance, improving over <span id="S5.T2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Global Attention</span> and <span id="S5.T2.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Global+Local</span> on GSM8K. <math id="S5.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> is relative to <span id="S5.T2.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Global Attention</span> (green/red denote improvement/regression), and <span id="S5.T2.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Avg. Rank<math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span> is the mean rank across reported metrics (lower is better).</span></figcaption>
